palettes='<h2>Four ways to stand out.</h2><p>Individual app tiles can use your accent, a light or dark surface, or a quiet outline.</p><div class="grid" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:28px">'+tile('Accent','camera','accented')+tile('Light','file','light')+tile('Dark','calendar')+tile('Outline','message','outline')+'</div><h2>Focus</h2><div class="grid">'+tile('Camera','camera','outline')+tile('Files','file','outline')+tile('Calendar','calendar','outline')+tile('Clock','clock','outline')+'</div>'
